Warning [jet.UnusedParameter]: Parameter `unused` is never used.
  --> unused_parameter_match_subject.jet:24:35
    |
 24 | fn early(ready: Bool, value: Int, unused: Int) -> Int {
    |                                   ^^^^^^
 Why: An unused parameter often means the function contract or implementation is incomplete; Jet keeps this warning-only so prototypes stay unblocked.
 Fix: Use `unused`, rename it to `_unused` when it is intentionally unused, or remove it from the function contract.
